@@ -241,7 +241,7 @@ placeholder.
 The fixed resource and producer policy is also explicit: occupancy `1`, SM
 count from `NvidiaTargetInfo`, reduction tile size `128`, persistence `none`,
 sanitized assembler environment v1, a 300-second assembler limit, 4096 MiB
-child address-space limit, a 64 MiB per-file limit enforced by `RLIMIT_FSIZE`,
+child data/RSS limit, a 64 MiB per-file limit enforced by `RLIMIT_FSIZE`,
 and a 64 KiB returned-diagnostic limit. The Linux strict child closes every
 descriptor above stderr with fail-closed `close_range` before exact `execve`.
 All TensorIR IR dump/load, print-tree, and timing debug options are empty or
diff --git a/docs/zh/dev/backend/01-nvidia-target-info.md b/docs/zh/dev/backend/01-nvidia-target-info.md
index d7125c4b87887390ea65750ee6c7885f0ddaca51..6c0e711dbc3ced419ea82886a56601634ba07ca6 100644
--- a/docs/zh/dev/backend/01-nvidia-target-info.md
+++ b/docs/zh/dev/backend/01-nvidia-target-info.md
@@ -215,7 +215,7 @@ CMake 会验证该 identity，避免 pipeline revision 变成无法解释的 pla
 
 固定 resource/producer policy 也被显式记录：occupancy 为 `1`、SM count 来自
 `NvidiaTargetInfo`、reduction tile size 为 `128`、persistence 为 `none`，并使用
-sanitized assembler environment v1、300 秒 assembler 上限、4096 MiB child memory
+sanitized assembler environment v1、300 秒 assembler 上限、4096 MiB child data/RSS
 上限、由 `RLIMIT_FSIZE` 强制的每文件 64 MiB 上限，以及 64 KiB returned-diagnostic
 上限。Linux strict child 会在 exact `execve` 前通过 fail-closed `close_range` 关闭
 stderr 以上的所有 file descriptor。
